FURB181 [*] Use of hashlib's `.digest().hex()`
  --> FURB181.py:61:5
   |
60 |   hashed = (
61 | /     sha512(b"some data")
62 | |     .digest(
63 | |         # text
64 | |     )
65 | |     .hex()
   | |__________^
66 |   )
   |
help: Replace with `.hexdigest()`
   |
61 -     sha512(b"some data")
62 -     .digest(
63 -         # text
64 -     )
65 -     .hex()
61 +     sha512(b"some data").hexdigest()
   |
note: This is an unsafe fix and may change runtime behavior
